        <mxCell id="t2" value="writer → fact-checker → reviewer → editor is strictly sequential. The fact-checker is a hard gate: it loops to the writer until no claim is wrong/unverifiable. Finalize checks after the editor run in parallel." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=10;fontColor=#888888;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="44" width="1000" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

